---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Deposit & Cancellation Policy — AASRA" description="Deposit payment and cancellation terms.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:720px;">
      <h1>Deposit &amp; Cancellation Policy</h1>
      <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> November 2026</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Deposit:</strong> 30% of the order total, payable online at checkout on eligible products.</li>
        <li><strong>Balance:</strong> the remaining 70% is due online before shipping. A secure pay-balance link is sent by email.</li>
        <li><strong>Balance deadline:</strong> pay within 7 days, or the order is auto-cancelled.</li>
        <li><strong>Cancellation before deposit paid:</strong> no charge; the order is cancelled.</li>
        <li><strong>Cancellation after deposit paid:</strong> the deposit is refunded per our refund timeline; the balance is not charged.</li>
        <li>Orders ship only when paid in full.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>These are default values and must be confirmed against your gateway and legal advice before launch.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
